  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티는 어딜 봐도\n포켓몬이 잔뜩 있어서 너무 좋아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B2940020C5B4B51C0020BD10B3C4000AD3ECCF13BAACC7740020C794B7290020C788C5B4C11C0020B108BB340020C88BC544002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬과 함께 사는 도시라는 말을 듣고\n미르를 여행지로 정하길 잘한 것 같아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020D568AED80020C0ACB2940020B3C4C2DCB77CB2940020B9D0C7440020B4E3ACE0000ABBF8B974B97C0020C5ECD589C9C0B85C0020C815D558AE380020C798D55C0020AC830020AC19C544002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 포켓몬과 사이가 좋은 걸로 따지면\n우리도 지지 않는다고 생각해.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020C0ACC774AC000020C88BC7400020AC78B85C0020B530C9C0BA74000AC6B0B9ACB3C40020C9C0C9C00020C54AB294B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D574002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬들은\n처음엔 삐와 이어롤이었는데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C740000ACC98C74CC5D40020C090C6400020C774C5B4B864C774C5C8B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "계~속 함께 여행했더니\n삐삐랑 이어롭으로 진화했거든!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACC4007EC18D0020D568AED80020C5ECD589D588B354B2C8000AC090C090B7910020C774C5B4B86DC73CB85C0020C9C4D654D588AC70B4E0002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 아이들은 트레이너와\n매우 친해져야만 진화할 수 있다구!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C544C774B4E4C7400020D2B8B808C774B108C640000AB9E4C6B00020CE5CD574C838C57CB9CC0020C9C4D654D5600020C2180020C788B2E4AD6C002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참! 우리가 얼마나 사이좋은지\n포켓몬 승부로 확인해 보지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC3800210020C6B0B9ACAC000020C5BCB9C8B0980020C0ACC774C88BC740C9C0000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020D655C778D5740020BCF4C9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 할 수 있을 때\n내게 말을 걸어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5600020C2180020C788C7440020B54C000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나랑 삐삐, 이어롭으로 구성된\n우리 사이좋은 팀과 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B7910020C090C090002C0020C774C5B4B86DC73CB85C0020AD6CC131B41C000AC6B0B9AC0020C0ACC774C88BC7400020D300ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에이~ 아쉽다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0C774007E0020C544C27DB2E4002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 사이좋게 승부하자!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C0ACC774C88BAC8C0020C2B9BD80D558C790002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아~ 졌다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544007E0020C84CB2E4002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 너희\n호흡이 척척 맞더라!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020B108D76C000AD638D761C7740020CC99CC990020B9DEB354B77C002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리랑 비슷할 정도로\n서로 사이가 좋은가 보네!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACB7910020BE44C2B7D5600020C815B3C4B85C000AC11CB85C0020C0ACC774AC000020C88BC740AC000020BCF4B124002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗, 그런데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C557002C0020ADF8B7F0B370002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 아이들,\n져서 충격을 받았을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C544C774B4E4002C000AC838C11C0020CDA9ACA9C7440020BC1BC558C7440020AC70C57C002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "평소처럼 카페에서 쉬어야겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3C9C18CCC98B7FC0020CE74D398C5D0C11C0020C26CC5B4C57CACA0C5B4002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카페에서\n포켓몬들과 함께 휴식하는 것!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74D398C5D0C11C000AD3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC0020D568AED80020D734C2DDD558B2940020AC83002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이게 포켓몬과 절친이 되는 비법이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC8C0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020C808CE5CC7740020B418B2940020BE44BC95C774C57C002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 포켓몬들과 함께\n휴식을 즐겨 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC0020D568AED8000AD734C2DDC7440020C990ACA80020BD10002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
